Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:03.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Knight to Queen's Bishop 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:03.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}骑士走到五吃下主教
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah. Very nice. What's Leonard gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常好 莱纳德会怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:08.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does he give up the pawn or give up the position?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:08.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他会放弃卒子还是位置？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:11.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mm. Let's find out. Leonard, ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:11.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们拭目以待 莱纳德 你准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:14.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:14.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.18,0:00:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.18,0:00:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.81,0:00:20.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[HUMMING IN UNISON KHACHATURIAN'S "SABRE DANCE"]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:37.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BUZZER SOUNDS]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:40.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn it. I slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:40.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该死 我滑倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:45.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Too bad. You know the rules of Secret Agent Laser Obstacle Chess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:45.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太不幸了 你应该很清楚 激光障碍特工西洋棋赛的规则
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:48.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard died again, Sheldon. You're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:48.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德又死了 谢尔顿 轮到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.26,0:00:51.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Despite my deep love of chess, lasers and aerosol disinfectant...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.26,0:00:51.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}尽管我对于西洋棋、激光 与杀菌剂有满腔热爱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.01,0:00:53.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I must forfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.01,0:00:53.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我必须弃权
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.93,0:00:56.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why? -Because it's almost 11:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.93,0:00:56.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -因为现在快11点了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.56,0:00:58.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So? -So Penny has a...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.56,0:00:58.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那又怎样？ -佩妮规定…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:01:02.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}..."Don't knock on my door before 11:00 or I punch you in the throat" rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:01:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}11点前敲门 就掐断你喉咙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.86,0:01:04.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.06,0:01:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:08.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you know what would be a great idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:08.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.82,0:01:13.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We get some girls over here and play Laser Obstacle Strip Chess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.82,0:01:13.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们找一些女孩来玩 激光障碍脱衣西洋棋赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:18.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Believe me, any girl willing to play that, you don't wanna see naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:18.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相信我 愿意玩这种游戏的女生 你不会想看到她们裸体的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.25,0:01:22.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.25,0:01:22.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你低估我了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.34,0:01:30.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.34,0:01:30.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:32.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny. Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:32.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.93,0:01:34.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.93,0:01:34.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.47,0:01:39.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's 11 a.m. -I know. You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.47,0:01:39.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-已经11点了 -我知道 你很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.06,0:01:42.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This package came while you were at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.06,0:01:42.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你上班的时候 邮差送来了这个包裹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:43.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great, my rhinestones. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:43.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 我的莱茵石 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:45.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Excuse me. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:45.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-等等 -怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.23,0:01:47.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to sign this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.23,0:01:47.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得签字
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:48.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:48.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.61,0:01:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I signed for the package, I was deputized by the United Parcel Service...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.61,0:01:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当我签收包裹时 美国邮政服务给我授权
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:56.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and entrusted with its final delivery. I need you to acknowledge receipt...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:56.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}并相信我会送达目的地 现在我需要你签收收据
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:59.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so that I'm fully indemnified and no longer liable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:59.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样我才可以完成任务 不再需要负责
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.16,0:02:02.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, it's just a box of rhinestones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.16,0:02:02.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 这只不过是盒莱茵石而已
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.62,0:02:05.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Contents are irrelevant. A legal bailment has been created.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.62,0:02:05.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}内容物并不重要 这是一项法律契约
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:07.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does that mean nothing to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:07.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道这对你没有意义吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:09.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It means nothing to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:09.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对任何人都没有意义
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.05,0:02:13.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Let me show you what I'm doing. -Bailment...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.05,0:02:13.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你来看看我在做什么 -契约…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:15.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...describes a relationship in common law...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:15.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在法律上指涉…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:18.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...where a physical possession of personal property, or chattels...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:18.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}特定的个人财产或动产
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:22.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is transferred from one person, the bailer, to another person, the bailee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}由委托人转交给受托人的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:25.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, yeah. Look, look. I started a business.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:25.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}懂了 你看 我在自己创业
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:29.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Obviously not a cleaning business.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:29.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很显然不是保洁业
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:33.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I'm making flower barrettes. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:33.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是 我在做花发夹 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.19,0:02:37.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I call them Penny Blossoms. I made one for myself. All the girls at work wanted one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.19,0:02:37.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我叫它“佩妮开花” 我做了一支 同事看到也想要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:40.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I showed some to this lady who runs a shop. She sells cards and jewelry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:40.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我给一家小店老板娘看过 她专门卖卡片跟手工珠宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.87,0:02:45.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She wanted to sell them, I said okay, and in one week, I made a $156.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.87,0:02:45.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她想帮我卖 我答应了 一个礼拜下来 我赚了156美元
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:48.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good for you. Sign here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:48.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来不错 快签名
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:54.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, don't you get it? If this takes off, I won't have to be a waitress anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:54.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你还不懂吗？ 如果一切顺利 我就不用当服务生了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:57.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But then who will bring me my cheeseburger on Tuesday nights?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:57.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么星期二晚上 谁会给我端起司汉堡呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.30,0:02:59.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Another waitress?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.30,0:02:59.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}另外一个服务生？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:02.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's her name? -I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她叫什么名字？ -我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:04.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you're going to let her handle my food?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:04.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就这样让她碰我的食物？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.85,0:03:07.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nancy. Her name is Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.85,0:03:07.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}南西 她叫南西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:09.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think you're just making that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:09.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想这是你编出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:13.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, I'm sorry about your hamburger, okay? I just don't wanna be a waitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:13.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我为你汉堡的事感到抱歉 我只是不想一辈子当服务生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cheeseburger. I get a cheeseburger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}起司汉堡 我吃起司汉堡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.45,0:03:20.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Fine. Cheeseburger. -Maybe I'd be better off with Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.45,0:03:20.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好吧 起司汉堡 -或许南西还比较细心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.74,0:03:23.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what do you think? I mean, this could be a business, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.74,0:03:23.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得如何？这生意应该不错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:28.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How many of these can you make a day? -Mm. About 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:28.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你一天可以做几个？ -大概20个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.71,0:03:32.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And how much profit do you make per Penny Blossom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.71,0:03:32.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每个“佩妮开花”可以赚多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:36.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I don't know. Like, 50 cents. I'm not sure. -No, of course you're not. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:36.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不知道 大概50美分吧 -你当然不知道 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:43.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ten dollars a day times five days a week times 52 weeks a year is $2600.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:43.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一天10美元乘以一周五天 乘以52周 你一年赚2600美元
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.14,0:03:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That's all? -Before taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.14,0:03:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-只有这么点？ -还是税前呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:49.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I don't have to pay taxes on this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:49.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这点东西应该不用缴税吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.31,0:03:52.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Internal Revenue Service would strongly disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.31,0:03:52.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}国税局会强烈反对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.57,0:03:56.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if you took advantage of modern marketing techniques...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.57,0:03:56.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过 假使你能利用现代推销技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:03:58.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and optimized your manufacturing process...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:03:58.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}改进你的制造过程
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.11,0:04:01.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you might make this a viable business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.11,0:04:01.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个生意或许做得起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:02.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you know about that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:02.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你懂这些东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.21,0:04:09.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a physicist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.21,0:04:09.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是个物理学家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:14.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a working knowledge of the entire universe and everything it contains.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:14.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂得这个宇宙所有相关的知识
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:18.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's Radiohead?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁是电台司令？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:35.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a working knowledge of the important things in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:35.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂得这个宇宙重要事情的知识
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.61,0:04:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Good luck. -Sheldon, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.61,0:04:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-祝你好运 -谢尔顿 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:42.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could you maybe show me how to make more money with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:42.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能不能告诉我 该怎么做才能赚更多钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:44.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:44.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当然能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.78,0:04:46.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.78,0:04:46.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你愿意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:54.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just to be clear here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:54.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先说清楚一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:56.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're asking for my assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:56.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要我帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.63,0:04:57.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.63,0:04:57.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:05:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you understand that will involve me telling you what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:05:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道这意味着我要向你解释怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:04.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:04.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:08.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you're not allowed to be sarcastic or snide to me while I'm doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:08.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在此期间 你不能挖苦我 或对我说刻薄话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.56,0:05:12.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.56,0:05:12.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:14.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:14.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:19.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's begin with the premise that everything you've done up to this point is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:19.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}首要前提是 你之前基本都做错了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:23.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, imagine that. -Sarcasm. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:23.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-可以想象 -你在讽刺我 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:25.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm sorry. Wait. Please, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:25.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 对不起 等等 求求你回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.69,0:05:55.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-There. Done. -All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.69,0:05:55.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 做好了 -好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:57.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Twelve minutes and 17 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:57.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用了12分17秒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:05:59.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, pretty good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:05:59.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还不错 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:01.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's 4.9 Penny Blossoms per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:01.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每小时可以做4点9个“佩妮开花”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:04.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Based on your cost of materials and your wholesale selling price...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:04.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据你的材料成本跟批发价
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.70,0:06:09.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you'll effectively be paying yourself $5.19 a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.70,0:06:09.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一天可以赚5点19美元
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:11.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:11.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一天？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.29,0:06:15.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are children in a sneaker factory in Indonesia who out-earn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.29,0:06:15.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}印尼运动鞋工厂的童工都赚得比你多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:18.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That just can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:18.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定是哪里搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're questioning my math? -No, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你质疑我的数学？ -不是 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:23.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Would you like me to show my work? -God, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:23.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要看看整个计算流程吗？ -老天 不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:26.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Just please tell me what to do about it. -All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:26.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-告诉我该如何改进就行了 -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:29.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you familiar with the development that resulted from Honoré Blanc's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:29.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道1778年欧诺莱布兰克…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...1778 use of interchangeable parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:32.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}使用可互换零件后产生的影响吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:39.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The assembly line, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:39.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是生产线
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:43.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, if I'm not allowed to be snide, you're not allowed to be condescending.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我不能说刻薄话 你也不能说话高人一等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.53,0:06:47.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That wasn't a part of our original agreement and I do not agree to it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.53,0:06:47.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不是我们原先的协议 我不会同意的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.82,0:06:51.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How are we supposed to set up machines and conveyor belts in my apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.82,0:06:51.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 那该如何在我公寓里 架设机器跟输送带呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:53.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're thinking of the moving assembly line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:53.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想到的是移动的生产线
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:06:57.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}An understandable, but not excusable, mistake. Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:06:57.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以理解 但这个错误不可原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:07:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the moving assembly line, that was introduced by Henry Ford in 1908.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:07:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}移动的生产线是在1908年 由亨利福特发明的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:05.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That innovation is what made possible our modern consumer culture...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:05.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这项创新可以低制造产品的成本
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:07.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...by enabling a low unit cost for manufactured goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:07.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}带来当代的消费文化
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.97,0:07:12.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess that isn't one of the topics discussed on your Radiohead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.97,0:07:12.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想这个议题电台司令不会讨论到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:18.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're gonna miss the coming attractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们走吧 不然就会错过预告片
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.02,0:07:19.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GROANS]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.15,0:07:21.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.15,0:07:21.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:28.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I bruised a testicle capturing that last pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:28.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想刚刚为了那个卒子 可能扭伤了一个睾丸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:34.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PENNY &amp; SHELDON SINGING "BLOW THE MAN DOWN"]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:38.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY &amp; SHELDON [SINGING]: Give me some time to blow the man down
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:41.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a deep-water sailor Just come from Hong Kong
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.42,0:07:44.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}BOTH: To me way, hey, blow the man down
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.51,0:07:47.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you give me some whiskey I'll sing you a song
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:50.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Give me some time To blow the man down
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:52.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:54.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN UNISON] Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.85,0:07:57.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come quickly, lay aft To the break of the poop
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:08:00.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To me way, hey Blow the man down
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:03.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or I'll help you along With the toe of my boot
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:05.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY &amp; SHELDON: Give me some time to blow the man down
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.94,0:08:08.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.94,0:08:08.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.49,0:08:10.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I assume you're referring to the sea shanty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.49,0:08:10.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你指的是我们唱的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:13.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a rhythmic work song to increase productivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:13.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是一首押韵的劳动歌曲 目的是用来提高生产力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.58,0:08:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. It's crazy, but it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.58,0:08:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这首歌很疯狂 但的确有效
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:18.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, we made this Penny Blossom in under three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:18.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看 不到三分钟 就能做一个“佩妮开花”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.41,0:08:23.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Terrific, but that kind of raises more questions than it answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.41,0:08:23.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 不过这么一来 我的疑问就更多了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny's making hair accessories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮在做发饰的生意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.05,0:08:27.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm helping her optimize her manufacturing process.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.05,0:08:27.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我帮她改进整个制造流程
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.59,0:08:28.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, break's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.59,0:08:28.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 休息结束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:32.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SINGING] Pay attention to orders Now you one and all
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.09,0:08:35.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you using as a bonding agent? -Hot glue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.09,0:08:35.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你用什么来黏？ -热熔胶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:38.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're kidding. Any of the cyanoacrylates would do a better job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:38.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的假的？ 氰基丙烯酸酯的效果更好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.39,0:08:41.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Won't work. The flower's porous. -What if we infused the bottom layer...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.39,0:08:41.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没用 花会渗水 -如果我们将底层…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:44.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with silicone RTV to provide a better mounting surface?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:44.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}涂上矽胶原液让它表面更加黏着呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:46.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Intriguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:46.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:49.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are your marketing and distribution channels?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:49.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们的销售跟经销渠道呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The waitresses at my work, and this cute shop--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}餐厅的同事跟一家小店…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:55.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hush, hush, hush. Virtually nonexistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:55.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}几乎可以说没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:59.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm thinking that we set her up with a hosted turnkey e-commerce system to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:59.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想 首先我们应该帮她 设计一个电子商务系统
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:01.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Eliminate the middle man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:01.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要什么中介系统？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:04.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A small server farm with a static IP in her bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:04.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要以她的卧室为中心 建一个小服务器群就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.34,0:09:07.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-She'll need some kind of cooling system. -Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.34,0:09:07.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她得需要工业级的冷却系统 -这当然
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:09.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But before we set up a marketing infrastructure...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:09.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们在进行销售基础建设以前
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:13.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we should finish optimizing the manufacturing process.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:13.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们应该先改进制造流程
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.39,0:09:17.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She has a terrible problem with moisture-induced glitter clump.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.39,0:09:17.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}闪粉因为受潮结成块了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.39,0:09:20.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, it's a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.39,0:09:20.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 烦死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:25.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah, I've seen this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:25.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我见过这东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.61,0:09:28.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Where? -It's a common stripper problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.61,0:09:28.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-在哪里？ -这在脱衣舞娘身上很常见
