Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.43,0:14:09.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要做什么？ -上网去买鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.06,0:14:12.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SINGING] She'll be coming 'round the mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:14.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-When she comes -When she comes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.73,0:14:16.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She'll be coming 'round the mountain When she comes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:18.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: When she comes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.27,0:14:20.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: She'll be coming 'round the mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:21.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}BOTH: She'll be coming 'round the mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.78,0:14:24.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I wanted to spend my Saturday nights doing this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.78,0:14:24.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我想在周末晚上做这个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:26.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I could have stayed in India.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:26.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干脆留在印度就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.49,0:14:30.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, stop with the fake third-world crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.49,0:14:30.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别再假装你是第三世界的穷人了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.83,0:14:34.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your father's a gynecologist and you had a house full of servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.83,0:14:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你爸是个妇科医生 你家一堆佣人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:37.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We only had four servants. And two of them were children.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:37.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们只有四个佣人 其中两个还是小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.84,0:14:41.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.84,0:14:41.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}进度如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.05,0:14:45.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have 128 assorted Penny Blossoms ready to ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.05,0:14:45.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已经包装好128个“佩妮开花”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.43,0:14:48.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, we're never gonna finish in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.43,0:14:48.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天 我们一定来不及的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.47,0:14:50.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hold. RAJESH: Who made Sheldon the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.47,0:14:50.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-等等 -谢尔顿凭什么当老大？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.43,0:14:54.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I believe I'm hearing some negativity on the factory floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.43,0:14:54.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我听到工厂里有些负面言论
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.23,0:14:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So? -The labor force is a living organism...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.23,0:14:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这又怎样？ -佩妮 劳动力是一种…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:00.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that must be nurtured.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:00.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}必须好好培养的有机体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:04.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Any counterproductive grumbling must be skillfully headed off...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:04.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}管理阶层的人必须有技巧地…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:07.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...by management. Observe. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对付这种不具建设性的牢骚 你看好了 嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.41,0:15:09.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Less talk, more work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.41,0:15:09.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别再说话 快点工作
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.29,0:15:14.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Nicely done. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.29,0:15:14.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-做得好 -谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:17.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You hear any union talk, you let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:17.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若听到工会的传言 就跟我说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SINGING WHILE YAWNING] Someone's in the kitchen with Dinah
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.76,0:15:25.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[WHISPERING]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.34,0:15:27.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SINGING] Someone's in the kitchen I know
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.97,0:15:29.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ho, ho, ho
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.18,0:15:34.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SINGING] Someone's in the kitchen with Dinah
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.98,0:15:36.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon. Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.98,0:15:36.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.27,0:15:37.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SINGING] 'Cause I sold my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To the company store
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.78,0:15:46.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Honey, do you want some coffee? -No, I don't drink coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.78,0:15:46.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要不要来点咖啡？ -不 我不喝咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.70,0:15:49.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you don't stay awake, we'll never finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.70,0:15:49.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你不清醒点 我们永远做不完
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. Coffee is out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很抱歉 我不喝咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:55.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I moved to California, I promised my mother that I wouldn't start doing drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:55.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当我搬到加州时 我答应我妈不会嗑药
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:56.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:56.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.79,0:15:59.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, we still have 380 of these things to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.79,0:15:59.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我们还有380个要做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.79,0:16:02.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have faith that you will make them. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.79,0:16:02.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我深信你们会成功的 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:04.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard. -Yeah-- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:04.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:10.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, Sheldon, without your insight and leadership, this enterprise will surely fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:10.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 没有你的洞察力跟领导力 这个企业注定会失败
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:15.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:15.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:17.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here, this will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:17.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喝一杯提神
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.23,0:16:21.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.23,0:16:21.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.36,0:16:23.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if this leads to opiates or hallucinogenics...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.36,0:16:23.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我上瘾或是产生幻觉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.90,0:16:26.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you're gonna have to answer to my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.90,0:16:26.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得负责向我妈解释
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:32.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at Planck's constant. People say that's arbitrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:32.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想想普朗克常数 大家都说太过武断了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.07,0:16:35.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That could not be less arbitrary. If it varied even slightly...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.07,0:16:35.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根本一点儿也不武断 就算只有些微变动…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...life as we know it would not exist. Bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个世界就会完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, now, let's reconsider the entire argument but with entropy reversed...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我们重新考虑整个论证过程 先把熵反向…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.05,0:16:47.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and effect preceding cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.05,0:16:47.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}倒因为果
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:51.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you are thinking of a universe. It's not expanding from the center, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:51.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}设想整个宇宙 其实不是从中心向外扩散
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.97,0:16:56.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is retreating from a possibility space. Bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.97,0:16:56.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}实际上是从可能性空间收缩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:17:03.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a space where we are all essentially Alice standing in front of the Red Queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:17:03.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个空间基本上让我们 就好像爱丽丝站在红心皇后面前
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:07.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and we're being offered a cracker to quench our thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}口渴了 只能用饼干解渴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:09.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.32,0:17:12.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In another universe, let's call that Universe Prime...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.32,0:17:12.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在另一个宇宙 姑且叫它原始宇宙好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.95,0:17:15.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...there's another Sheldon.... -We should have let him go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.95,0:17:16.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-还有另一个谢尔顿… -早知道该让他去睡觉的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.91,0:17:17.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.71,0:17:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe we actually did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.71,0:17:23.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信 我们居然办到了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:28.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One thousand frigging Penny Blossoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:28.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}1000个该死的“佩妮开花”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just want you guys to know I am really grateful for your help...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想对你们说 非常感谢你们的协助
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:35.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and for every dollar I make, I'm gonna give you 20 cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:35.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只要赚一元 就分给你们20美分
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:38.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's your entire profit margin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:38.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的利润也就这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:41.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Then never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:41.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.35,0:17:45.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll print out the shipping label.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.35,0:17:45.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来打印出货标签
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:48.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.23,0:17:50.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.23,0:17:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.49,0:17:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We got an email from the East Rutherford, New Jersey, Gay, Lesbian, Bisexual...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.49,0:17:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚收到一封 来自新泽西州东卢瑟福德…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:56.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and Transgender Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:56.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}同性恋双性恋及跨性别同盟的 电子邮件
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.79,0:18:00.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They want another 1000 Penny Blossoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.79,0:18:00.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们再追加1000个“佩妮开花”
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.58,0:18:04.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Really? -One-day rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.58,0:18:04.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的吗？ -当日急单
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.75,0:18:08.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really need to take that off the website.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.75,0:18:08.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的应该把这个选项 从网页上撤掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.80,0:18:11.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, guess we better get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.80,0:18:11.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来我们最好开始动工
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:13.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:13.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的假的？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.43,0:18:18.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, come on. What about the living organism of the work force...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.43,0:18:18.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 不是说过什么劳动力有机体
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:20.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and the American spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以及美国精神
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.81,0:18:24.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And Jiminy Crockett at the Alamo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.81,0:18:24.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}阿拉莫战役的吉米克洛柯特？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.73,0:18:28.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Davy Crockett. Jiminy Crockett was a cricket.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.73,0:18:28.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是大卫克洛柯特 吉米克洛柯特是只蟋蟀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.11,0:18:32.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I know that, okay? I'm tired and I've had 18 cups of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.11,0:18:32.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当然知道 我只是累了 还喝了18杯咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.36,0:18:37.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The point is, if we all just pull together, we can do this. Who's with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.36,0:18:37.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重点是 只要我们合作 我们就能办到 你们说对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.29,0:18:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, although you may find it hard to believe, we do have lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.29,0:18:47.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 尽管你可能难以相信 但我们都有自己的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.84,0:18:52.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.84,0:18:52.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:55.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:55.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.14,0:18:59.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My apologies to the gay community of East Rutherford, New Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.14,0:18:59.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只能对新泽西州东卢瑟福德的 同性恋团体说抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:07.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Zoom, zoom, zoom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:07.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冲啊…
